// A US citizen who moved from San Francisco to Berlin on 2025-07-01. Calendar year
// 2025. Reports are in dollars; the German pay, rent and savings are in euros, and
// a trip to London is in pounds.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2025/07.ax holds July 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us/401k
use us/abroad/de

/// Dana, 37, single. San Francisco until the end of June, Berlin from July 1.
/// `lives` says where, and dates when: the second line ends the first.
///
/// A US citizen stays under United States law wherever they live, and `lives` cannot
/// name two jurisdictions at once, so Berlin is spelled `us/abroad/de`: under `us`
/// (by its path) and under Germany. See systems/us/abroad.ax.
entity me : person
  born   1987-09-14
  filing single
  lives  us/ca/san-francisco
  lives  us/abroad/de from 2025-07-01
